ough_seq` in code**, not just docs: `lineage.ts:37,43,47,63,71` (write+read+parse), and consumed downstream in `turnbridge/src/targets/codex.ts` reasoning-replay logic. Also documented in `turnbridge/docs/PRODUCT_INTENT.md` and `turnbridge/docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md` (grepped, present but code is primary).\n5. Comment at `turnbridge/src/lineage.ts:26-28`: *\"Stored as a ledger event so the edge travels and syncs with the conversations it links, using conversation-ledger's `links` extension point.\"*\n\n## context-graph — design docs only, no code\n- Status: last commit 2026-08-04; **no `src/` and no test files anywhere** (`find` for `.py/.ts/.js` returned nothing besides `.claude`/`.git`/`docs`). Pure design-stage repo.\n1. Not a dependent — no package.json/pyproject; would read via library API or `cledger export` (`docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md:81-82`: *\"Conversation Ledger, via its library API (`readEvents`, `sortEvents`) or `cledger export`, grouped by `conversation.id`\"*).\n2. Design-doc modeling only: `docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md:55-60` defines a planned `continuation` edge derived from turnbridge's `links` `rel:\"continues\"` and `imported_through_seq` (dedup semantics), and an `anchored_to` edge from ledger `context.head`.\n5. `docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md:43-47`: *\"Edges are typed and evidence-bearing: `{src, dst, kind, basis}`... There is no confidence field: every edge is mechanically derived from explicit\"* evidence. `README.md` calls context-graph \"a data structure, not a product surface,\" deliberately undecided on consumer API (`docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md:132-137`).\n\n## intent-recall — design docs only, no code\n- Status: last commit 2026-07-30; **no `src/`, no tests** (only `.claude`, `docs`, `.git`).\n1. Not a dependent yet; described as a prospective ledger reader.\n2. `README.md:13-16`: *\"Intent Recall reads the conversation record that Conversation Ledger... captures into git notes\"* — read intent stated, but purely aspirational (no filter logic, no code exists).\n3/4. No write logic, no continuation/imported_through_seq handling anywhere.\n\n## ds4-gateway, tunalab, tagseq2tagseq — no involvement\n- Grep for `conversation-ledger|cledger|readEvents|appendEvents|imported_through_seq|producer\\.tool|continuation` across source/docs returned **zero matches** in ds4-gateway and tunalab.\n- tagseq2tagseq matches are false positives (unrelated NLP \"link\"/\"KB\" research notes and a `link_annotator.py` for its own graph-training research, not ledger-related).\n\n## sticky-note\n- Does not exist anywhere under `/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/` (no directory, no mention in any repo).</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>25450</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>13</tool_uses><duration_ms>232712</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>","type":"text"}],"operation":"enqueue"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"324e5de5bd856853a4c994915cf2b93c8a3d6e6b","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"id":"ev2-825da8ac8c268e2a57475bd01221f0fd9679e9f94f18e92c1b985155b401ae96","kind":"activity","meta":{"actor":{"type":"system"},"session_id":"a044dbb5-5e38-4400-bb2a-97061ee33f87","source":"claude-code"},"occurred_at":"2026-08-24T02:23:53.394Z","producer":{"tool":"cledger","version":"0.25.0"},"raw":{"data":{"content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>ad1235822d738b883</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01Xxd2ijNuxJTrCqXfAFasDH</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-evintunador-repos-evintunador-conversation-ledger/a044dbb5-5e38-4400-bb2a-97061ee33f87/tasks/ad1235822d738b883.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Survey sibling consumers of cledger\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result># Survey: si