 graph, `README.md:75-84`) and in custom attention masks (`doc_causal`, `cross_doc_link`, `doc_concat_link`, `doc_concatenated`, `README.md:21-71`).\n\n**Lineage tracking is real and DAG-shaped**, in `provenance/`: each training run produces one `provenance/runs/<run_id>.json` record (`schema_version`, `run_id`, git `commit_hash`/dirty flag + a content-addressed `patches/<sha256>.patch` for uncommitted diffs, resolved `hyperparameters` including `config_path` and `dataset_dir`, environment, and `eval.metrics`). Runs link to prior runs via `reproduce.cli_overrides[\"resume-from\"]` pointing at another run's checkpoint path (e.g. `provenance/runs/run_20260819_144147_693022.json`: `\"resume-from\": \"runs/run_20260818_020329_564573/checkpoints/latest.pt\"`), forming a checkpoint-resumption chain. Artifacts per run: git commit + patch, config, checkpoints, eval metrics JSON — linked run→config, run→patch, run→parent-run (via checkpoint), run→claim-key (via `ledger.yaml`). Capture side is an external package (`tunalab.reproducibility.ReproducibilityManager`, `provenance/README.md:60-63`); this repo's tools only read/distill/check.","type":"text"}],"diagnostics":null,"id":"msg_011CeLrrAdV7gWaEVzTTo81A","model":"claude-sonnet-5","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":882},"cache_creation_input_tokens":882,"cache_read_input_tokens":35143,"inference_geo":"not_available","input_tokens":2,"iterations":[{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":882},"cache_creation_input_tokens":882,"cache_read_input_tokens":35143,"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2264,"type":"message"}],"output_tokens":2264,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_fetch_requests":0,"web_search_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","speed":"standard"}},"parentUuid":"095b5c01-96ec-4a4d-9373-d6292043c8f0"