{"content":{"blocks":[{"text":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a0468aee6692a7819</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_011A6Pir6ZsyXKTXAfWh6z54</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-evintunador-repos-evintunador-conversation-ledger/a044dbb5-5e38-4400-bb2a-97061ee33f87/tasks/a0468aee6692a7819.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Survey tagseq2tagseq DAG/traceability design\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Clean tree, HEAD at `5c15f9d` (2026-08-20), 458 commits total.\n\n## Repo status\n- Last commit: `5c15f9d0` \"Merge pull request #7 from evintunador/provenance-grounding\", 2026-08-20 14:52 -0400 (working tree clean, no uncommitted changes).\n- Size: `paper/` 2.0M vs code dirs — `provenance/` 19M (mostly gitignored run JSON), `model/` 632K, `configs/` 1.2M, `scripts/` 292K, `data/` 1.1M, `docs/` 764K, `eval/` 572K, `kernels/` 520K. No top-level `src/`; core training code lives at repo root (`main.py`, `generate.py`, `eval_checkpoints.py`, `launch_slurm.py`) plus `model/`, `kernels/`, `eval/`.\n- Languages: 292 `.py`, 220 `.yaml`, 111 `.patch`, 73 `.md`, 19 `.tex`, plus a handful of `.zig/.rs/.go/.dart/.kt/.java` (likely test-corpus fixtures for the import-link detectors, not project code).\n- Top-level: `README.md, INSTRUCTIONS.md, RESULTS*.md, TODOS.md, TUNING_LESSONS.md, CLAUDE.md, benchmarks/, configs/, data/, demo_data/, docs/, eval/, kernels/, model/, optimizers/, paper/, provenance/, results/, scripts/, tests/, tunalab/`.\n\n## 1. paper/ — traceability system\n\n`paper/` is a LaTeX paper source tree (`paper/README.md`) whose real \"system\" is a **claim-provenance pipeline**, not a paper-internal DAG format:\n\n- **Code briefs** (`paper/notes/code_briefs/*.md`, 12 files: masks, kernels, traversal, packing_density, l